WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.677
Nothing came back. Is the search over?

00:00:35.677 --> 00:01:10.130
Selected old queries met newer models

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:45.526
A good synonym expansion can still miss the problem

00:01:45.526 --> 00:02:15.901
Move from a subject name to a database’s coverage

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:50.481
Broader concepts and newer knowledge both matter

00:02:50.481 --> 00:03:25.335
Several comparisons narrow the explanation

00:03:25.335 --> 00:04:01.150
The library knows facts the open web cannot supply

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:40.000
Evaluate recovery as a property of the whole process
